# Deploy to production by default

After completing requested site changes for ayushkhaitan.com:

1. Commit the changes (concise message).
2. Deploy production immediately with:
   `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --scope ayushkhaitan`
3. Do not ask whether to go live, push live, or wait for approval.
4. Do not add a local-preview-then-prod workflow.

Only hold off on deploy if the user explicitly says local-only, draft, or hold deploy.
